<title>EGYPT: Egypt cuts discount rate to 13 pct from 13.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Egypt cuts discount rate to 13 pct from 13.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bank of Egypt has cut the discount rate to 13.00 percent from 13.25 percent, newspapers reported on Saturday.</p>
<p>The new rate would take effect on December 15, they said.</p>
